        will remain in full force and effect.
      </p>

      <h2>15. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms should be directed to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          {' '}<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={CONTACT.phoneHref}>{CONTACT.phone}</a>,
          {' '}{CONTACT.hours.display}
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Post:</strong> {SITE.name}, {LOCATIONS[0].full}
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-muted)]">
        Copyright © {year} {SITE.name}. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
